PE teacher ever. Serina and co gave him the nickname \"Sadistic Shizuka\". Wherever he goes, tears of innocent students are spilled in his wake."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2179"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/453b160d6213620cbd94f870279658c105da02225d232a14c45ea4a9480f4fee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf08b36d62f990e50a35a84348ea6e1765f026e1e2b1160b515744cc057f0925.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2262","characterName":"間部 由希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2262"},"originalCharacterName":"間部 由希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student at Kashima school, Serina's best friend and classmate. The only one member of the Kasuga Independent Gang with common sense. Albeit having a quiet and adult-like personality, she still is unable to stop Serina's rampage, thus always scolded along with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She developed feelings toward Tatsuya since junior high school, but knowing about his unrequited love with Serina, she really can't break the ice. She's great at cleaning and cooking, a family-oriented girl. She has been playing the piano since her childhood and is fond of animals."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2262"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d7f6cbffa79b5acaf25662c57622501383815ad727ce207b3c4ed5cd43f6a23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/928956fdb314046418cbe8d96790693b0aa8a98da0a3dca1ba5666ec3797a02d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2273","characterName":"新島 早苗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2273"},"originalCharacterName":"新島 早苗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third year student in the Kashima school and Serina's senpai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite Serina having weird acquaintances, Sanae still stands out as one of the most eccentric. She's a character always \"moving at her own pace\", and is totally nuts toward street dancing. She can rarely be seen at school. A really kindhearted girl, but due to her unusual behavior, her only close friends are Serina and co."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2273"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe4356f977f15dddae8150f3e1858169b4dd0a3184c51fc667c23599bafe7c74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78e7fda015df720de70e57bc9a6544e5885e55f926df79637745c188ff2c2450.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2274","characterName":"牧野 詩織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2274"},"originalCharacterName":"牧野 詩織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The homeroom teacher of Serina and co at the Kashima school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A zealous educator who took the job of being the homeroom teacher of the problem child, Yukinojou. Bound by the sense of duty and responsibility, she's definitely an ideal female teacher. She's also smart and has strong maternal instinct. She gently watches over her problematic pupils, while also occasionally helping them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2274"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdbd678e1aa6bd025be6999309a3bda58af3cd290967e356aff916bf32e67079.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6eaa8b0e428a68f4d66785e9b704e8538056c62ab5f4bfc64177141a687e595e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2276","characterName":"杉崎 怜於奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2276"},"originalCharacterName":"杉崎 怜於奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student at Kashima school and the class representative of Serina's class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her cold and harsh personality, she's pretty much isolated in class, despite her outstanding appearance and brilliant mind. Being at full contrast to Serina she doesn't get along well with her, often opposing each other. According to Serina, she's her \"natural enemy\". A complicated girl who can be labeled as a \"cool beauty\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d84e6d2f2a044b76d67b83eec51c0aa03c4bb525887c872a9ac4e9fa33ac95b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74afad251e688172e067417857033ca501ad37e97c654452d4e1a61df3390dff.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2281","characterName":"小松原 妙子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2281"},"originalCharacterName":"小松原 妙子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first year student in Kashima school and Serina's kouhai. Exaggeratedly cheerful, but at the same time can turn into a crybaby for the smallest reasons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She accidentally became acquainted to Serina via Yukinojou and her childish behavior always rubs Serina the wrong way. Once she's set her mind in something, she goes straight to it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a77e4c5f5e5c684f2ff67518692d31c3ca6d59a87b2d84df581406e549080dd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/195bfd88450617223f08e8ba7823a6407e9d79ac6f7f803e9beae59c7eaf76b3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2288","characterName":"合田 鉄平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2288"},"originalCharacterName":"合田 鉄平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student in Kashima school and a member of the Kasuga Independent Gang. The gang meetings always take place at his house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serina's childhood friend, he is secretly head over heels in love for her, thus he and Tatsuya are rivals ever since they were wee lads. But Serina only looks at them as ordinary childhood friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a huge frame, and a hearty lively attitude. His family owns the fish shop in Kashima which he will inherit one day."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a54200426f8582a728fdf28e0243290b243f776781154a163adc1514e6b40dd1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59717d13e35d5ddcf6dfed59bcb8dfbaf9692b086128aaac47ad3ad7f294dd7e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2289","characterName":"須崎 達也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2289"},"originalCharacterName":"須崎 達也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student of Kashima school, Serina's childhood friend and a member of the Kasuga Independent Gang. He's also head over heels in love for Serina. Unlike Teppei, he's a man of intellect, always fighting with Teppei over Serina. He has frameless glasses and is very popular in the school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2289"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30e143a453814b4ed1337846bc622e99e03b2169583dd13efa6462d58853770d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c83964701eaa24dc6f5da0655e63fee959bfad5b8b9172d2170b99c9cb551b69.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2385","characterName":"藍川 斉藤","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2385"},"originalCharacterName":"藍川 斉藤","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiharu's dad and her only parent."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Twenty years before he used to be a hard-hitter legendary pro boxer called \"Mach Saitou\" and became national champion in Bantamweight class (52.163 - 53.525 kg/115-118 pounds). He successfully protected his position several times during his career. Chiharu's fondness toward boxing and her skills are due to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's through with boxing nowadays though, and works at a construction company."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2385"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/5470f0f61a75c816e3ebe9eacb26b4128fb156826258490c62c951d535135838.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2cb7fd71a74c711e3356b4232199fab5eff44ef58185d5725e34e13cf821e00.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c251","characterName":"鷲淵 権造","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c251"},"originalCharacterName":"鷲淵 権造","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"601"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"186"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Washibuchi 'Eagle' Gonzou is a third year student in the general education curriculum of Ryouzuki school. He transferred to Masaru's class during the beginning of the game, and he's a huge guy with a funny countryside accent and somewhat anarchistic appearance - a diagonally worn school cap with a crack in front, wooden clogs and unshaven face. According to him, \"he came to Tokyo for the sake of becoming a better, manlier man\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He fell in love at first sight with Masaru's little sister, Shouko. From then on, he too starts worshipping Masaru, hanging out with him. Contrary to his scary face, he is quite clever, naive and has a strong sense of justice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gonzou's father is a wealthy politician in Tokyo, and is a big-shot member of the National Diet who is being rumored to become the next prime minister. Gonzou's ambition is to succeed after his dad."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c251"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58406f54a13b7659c7838b9b25418d586f98039d9c48160f2941f4bc868cd163.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e434d40fe336c7cec0be6c1b47445fb1d7bd4be1254f17901fb90fa62ec05335.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c252","characterName":"宇佐美 明男","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c252"},"originalCharacterName":"宇佐美 明男","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first year student at Ryouzuki school in the specially selected sports class, Masaru and Yukinojou's underclassman and a member of the school boxing club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A hot-blooded lad who is at odds with Yukinojou as he never could accept him with what he did to Masaru. He loves Shouko and untiredly makes moves on her, but his feelings, unfortunately, have yet to reach her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c252"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6041f18cef1bc72a079001f58b4a07b965e85ddfc1ed7daaf6675c131dc04f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cceec0e7f51c33f052d923b3bfbc58a9dcbb1f4b3f41414d405749b5bdb07b92.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c253","characterName":"春日 せりな","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c253"},"originalCharacterName":"春日 せりな","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"209"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student in Kashima school. Cheerful, vigorous, naive, a girl really knowledgeable about lots of trivia but at the same time failing at her own studies. Commander of the Kasuga Independent Gang."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hates things being obscured, and often does her utmost to unravel things forcefully, a really open character. An avid gamer of the game center in town along with her two childhood friends, Teppei and Tatsuya."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c253"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56cb2fb3fe2460e53b445129a4b93122e37f546c4bb24d1dc9914baaf13687e3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f21a18f5478e4fd49c298a2a3377af585fe57d0e86fcbf34e793cc40eec86999.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c254","characterName":"久保 晶子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c254"},"originalCharacterName":"久保 晶子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"908"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru's little sister and Yukinojou's childhood friend. She was the former manager of the boxing club when those two were still active members, even though she did not really enjoy boxing. The thought of her beloved brother and childhood friend \"beating\" each other always filled her with uneasiness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Following the accident sending Masaru into coma, she harshly condemned Yukinojou, who was unable to bear this and moved to Kashima city. Short while later Shouko followed him, as she didn't intend to let him off the hook so easily."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After becoming heartbroken during the first game's course and following Masaru's awakening, she came back to Ryouzuki. Nowadays, it seems she has completely gained back her normal cheerfulness and kindness. She's a reliable girl who takes care of her incompetent older brother and object of admiration for many in Ryouzuki school, especially for Gonzou and Akio."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c254"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16c461fb7d3204f9736436a3543a514a61831086c0841a764acfcb681af12d22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e875a28e57908396e1c33e3ed19143ada1cc4ee60c914164123cfcab9ec722dd.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c255","characterName":"水島 あきら","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c255"},"originalCharacterName":"水島 あきら","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"202"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru's classmate who spaces out all the time, and drives him up on the wall by always playing dumb. Her eyes are always droopy and she's a problem child who often has to take supplementary lessons along with Masaru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira is somehow aloof from the world, which creates discrepancy between her and her surroundings, causing her to be left out from class. Aside from Yumiko, her childhood friend, she doesn't mingle with others. She usually kills time by strolling around town until very late."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though her and Masaru's personalities are poles apart, she claims that they are holding an inseparable relationship with each other, and he has often been caught by Akira during her strolls, whereas she also weasels her way to get treated for food by him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c255"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/652b28bee541f8678a6d98262977915e8315579fc01f567e5b80c215ab2e0b6f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98a2ecf7b265c7ce912f43f1baef3edf267089e1f08fe6f6a4c20ef292c51b4c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c256","characterName":"桜瀬 由美子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c256"},"originalCharacterName":"桜瀬 由美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru's classmate and also Akira's childhood friend. She lost her parents in a traffic accident when she was a child and now is living with her uncle, who works as a teacher at Kashima school and, according to her, is really kind and gentle always helping her when she needs it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's not very unusual for her to be absent from school due to her very sudden fits of asthma, a chronic disease she holds."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She actually holds feelings for Yukinojou from the time he saved her during one of her asthma attacks, albeit he barely remembers her by now."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c256"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c56d59ae1f677b41bbddbd0c6b2a0349d335acaa66a62e264f8918b709c9130.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c9c338429473e31f5a01b2aaa0fe04b3e845cb1a787c042c3f9612c800f98ea.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2565","characterName":"会長","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2565"},"originalCharacterName":"会長","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"609"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His real name is unknown, but he's the Ryouzuki boxing gym's president, and everyone calls him as such."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru and Yukinojou's mentor, he was the one teaching them not only the ways of boxing but also unique styles of it. According to Masaru he's a \"fist-maniac\" old man who's been boxing around for more than 50 years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lately he's getting a bit too old for the boxing environment and is looking for a successor to entrust his gym onto."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2565"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91c13b808133dc2fe4e7cfd1b4e5fddb3d5fe9b4809708fd1600385c672d74a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cfa18faf872d83d66cb306921af0e99832f383b29131616911e850fbd9057af.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2568","characterName":"勝の母親","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2568"},"originalCharacterName":"勝の母親","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"44"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru and Shouko's mom. A lady whose heart is gold and her discipline is strict. Masaru inherited many of her characteristics, while it's claimed that Shouko is more similar to their dad instead."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though she's a lot more at home than her husband, she too is working full-time, which is why Shouko often has to cook the family meals and help around the household. In her younger days she used to be a prominent member of a biker gang, and she only settled down after marrying her husband."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2568"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bc33204c4ce3e9a4c02a74e9b87c7cdcdc42cf2601779a35d6005fce2b1adba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64b417c6831f93e56d4678d8383d6767086ce190712359bb59daa9ef4365eae5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c257","characterName":"藍川 ちはる","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c257"},"originalCharacterName":"藍川 ちはる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freshman this year and is the boxing club's new manager after Shouko. Her great interest in boxing led her to study extra hard so she could enter Ryouzuki school, a place famous of its boxing club. She's polite and has a very bright personality. An energetic and careless girl who works with a smile to support the boxing club."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c257"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d16c3a228df299f798907f2604b2112d1e9801674fa4eda696a95b53cbc289fb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9e2a01027c221ebf043a4234d13f942abc2fdfcfb66580b5c226310fa0f0872.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c258","characterName":"三枝 マキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c258"},"originalCharacterName":"三枝 マキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Selfish, arrogant and strong-willed, she is the heiress of a particular plutocrat. She graduated from Ryouzuki school three years ago and is currently a student at a certain top notch university."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaru was a freshman while she was a senior when she became his girlfriend. But right before her graduation she suddenly broke up with him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c258"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60062c45b3b5f36cd80522027cd6889fc3344ddb1fd00dd54dd14fd338741679.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20e9d2c7c61b5c2971d7a993e4f2c3ee68f57637b83a790b8d70073135a89fee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c259","characterName":"久保 勝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c259"},"originalCharacterName":"久保 勝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The title giver of the sequel game, Masaru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His boxing skills are probably at the same level as Yukinojou's, but due to his accident, it'd be quite difficult for him to continue. He was the one who introduced boxing to Yukinojou. They are best friends of each other and eternal rivals at boxing at the same time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's basically a huge and lovable idiot, but when it comes to making decisions, he's definitely a guy who'll make firm choices and stick to them. He's not a morning person though and most of the time if his sister, Shouko, or their mom wouldn't wake him up (with various -often violent- methods they devise) then he'd sleep 'till well into the afternoon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes studying and loves playing games (including those in the game centers), movies, model toys; one could very well say he's a male version of Serina."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c259"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e78c7ec9b209653f35c92cfcbb3409096a65336a75197cfa80c165edeb16cdbc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bfe85d4245b15b63edf0902601199e593dc73fc1df483e3b4ffe24c62ebdb43.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c397","characterName":"雪村 雪之丞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c397"},"originalCharacterName":"雪村 雪之丞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist and the title giver of Ashita no Yukinojou (the other half, \"Ashita no\", is a reference to the boxing manga Ashita no Joe). A genius boxer who after a certain incident completely abandoned boxing."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The aforementioned event shocked him so much that he is completely unable to hit anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He transferred to the second year of Kashima school, into Serina's class. He's exceedingly fit, but at the same time taciturn and unsociable toward everyone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c397"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df468c5cc9941f903b046e93035c467198d19ae1e16f3fcfe5665cd438be3645.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/8354e52396b893e29daeac8583c36b853af42840f0e422a3e25ce1d2fa49182f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:70","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:70","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:70","name":"elf","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:2284:70","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p131","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p131","name":"elf","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:5489:v2344","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p131","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p131","name":"elf","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:74659:v2344","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
